{"hash_algorithm":"sha256","ts":"2026-10-30T13:03:38.409Z","author":"harness:claude-code","author_source":"detected","agent_harness":"claude-code","agent_model":"claude-opus-5-5","agent_model_source":"probe","agent_instance":"7b0e58428f53e3aaeaafb372","agent_provenance":{"model":{"value":"claude-opus-5-5","source":"probe"},"effort":{"value":"xhigh","source":"environment"},"role":{"value":"implementer","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1626","claim:pm-gh1633","lineage:pm-gh1633","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"topic":{"value":"workset:pm-gh1626+pm-gh1633","source":"inferred","confidence":"medium","rule_version":"v2","evidence":["claim:pm-gh1626","claim:pm-gh1633","lineage:pm-gh1633","lineage:pm-mpbb","lineage:pm-doxj"]},"version":{"value":"2.1.312","source":"probe"}},"op":"comment_add","patch":[{"op":"add","path":"/metadata/comments/1","value":{"created_at":"2026-10-30T13:03:38.409Z","author":"harness:claude-code","text":"Implementation evidence: option 1 was adopted after proving its precondition. Pre-fix, pm schema add-field \"foo,bar\" registered a comma key and advertised an unusable --foo,bar flag (reproduced on d9c4a0bca), so field keys could contain commas. normalizeAddFieldInput now refuses comma keys and comma flags, which makes the split unambiguous. --unset is declared list: true on create, update and update-many, so argv normalisation coalesces repeats and the shared parser expands comma lists (expandUnsetFieldTokens). Each part is validated and refused by name: an unknown part gives 'Unsupported --unset field \"parnt\"', an empty part gives 'must not be empty'. Separate pre-existing defect fixed in the same seam: update many --unset <unknown> exited 0 with outcome no_effect in both dry run and apply, on both pre-fix and current builds, while update refused it. The bulk preview skipped absent fields and never called the validator. A planned-update validator now refuses it before planning. The legacy dry-run test that encoded the silent acceptance of missing-field was updated. Help, zsh/fish completion, the MCP unset parameter description, COMMANDS.md and SDK.md say 'repeatable or comma-separated'. Negative control: pre-fix create --unset parent,release refused 'Unsupported --unset field \"parent,release\"'; this build creates the item."}},{"op":"replace","path":"/metadata/updated_at","value":"2026-10-30T13:03:38.409Z"}],"before_hash":"03e03b53b8c9956e46751f51f53ad3c4e516987ad80890d19f81a628b9682dd4","after_hash":"ee502e00a8bd1029c0e040a144646c67dd7e9879e9fa2808cc28987fdbdfca97","item_hash_version":3,"context":{"agent_provenance_outcomes":{"model":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"},"version":{"status":"resolved","resolver":"claude_session_file","rule_version":"v1"}}},"event_class":"substantive","record_hash_version":1,"record_hash":"e14ca64ac4ee386f6b8a3239e72c6c9e446a54a1d283444a035b6f7930b1501f"}
